@* The animated story on the sign-in page, following the real workflow: a maker at a brokerage house raises a ticket;
   it joins the XFL queue at L1 and is auto-assigned to a free engineer (engineers can also take one, the manager can
   assign); the engineer escalates it to L2; the code change is tracked stage by stage while the client chats with the
   engineer; the ticket is closed, the maker rates it, and the house MD follows it all read only.
   Drawn in SVG (no images, works offline); css/xfl-story.css animates it and js/xfl-story.js runs the timeline.
   With "reduce motion" on, the finished story is shown still. *@
